--- OLD
DrawMapRowCol:
    LDX mapdraw_nty           ; get target row draw to
--- NEW
.import m7_rowcol
.export DrawMapRowCol           ; for tools/test_options.py
DrawMapRowCol:
    ;  On the overworld the row or column goes to the Mode 7 plane instead
    ;  (ow7.asm), and carry says it went; a standard map's is drawn here.
    JSL m7_rowcol + OW7FAR
    BCC :+
    RTS
:   LDX mapdraw_nty           ; get target row draw to
